      "id": "84274df3-c37f-4713-8173-e113100886df",
      "name": "Integrations",
      "description": {
        "content": "Integrations enable customers to connect their own cloud environments to the Plerion platform.\nIntegrations allow for the collection of data from the integrated environment, e.g. Connecting Plerion to your cloud service provider will facilitate Plerion to collect, analyze, and prioritize the most significant risks across your cloud operating environments.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
